{
    "title": "Top Drives \u2013 Car Cards Racing",
    "description": "Are you a true car enthusiast \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f? If so, turn your attention to Top Drives, the high-octane driving challenge that will put your skills and knowledge to the ultimate test! \ud83c\udfc1\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Think you know cars? Top Drives is not your typical racing game; it's an exciting card collecting game featuring a whopping 4000+ real-life cars. \ud83d\ude98  Collect, compare, and compete in thrilling racing battles against other players. \ud83c\udfc6\r\n \ud83d\udd27 Build the ultimate garage of customized cars and create your very own perfect racing deck for supercharged action against your friends or other drivers. Whether you prefer a tuned-up American muscle car, a feisty Japanese hot rod, or going turbo with European agility, you'll find a car that gets your motor running in Top Drives - the FREE car racing card collection game. \ud83c\udccf\r\n\r\nTop Drives is all about racing cars on a variety of roads, tracks, and challenges. If you like your driving fast and furious, you'll absolutely love Top Drives. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Hit the gas on asphalt circuits, slide your wheels around twisty tracks, master the art of drifting in the G Force tests, or speed to the checkered flag in a 1-100mph drag race. \ud83d\udea5 Whether it's a Mustang, Camaro, Porsche Turbo, Audi TT, or Nissan GTR, make sure you've got the right car for the right track. You'll need cars that can perform well in wet conditions, handle off-road challenges, take corners like a pro, and burn rubber for drag races. \ud83c\udf27\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc1\r\n\r\nWhy is Top Drives the ultimate motorsport experience for every car enthusiast? Here are the key features that set it apart:\r\n\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Build the perfect car racing deck from over 4000+ officially licensed cars, including marques like McLaren, Bugatti, Pagani, Porsche, Mercedes, Audi, Mustang, and more.\r\n\ud83d\udcca Real car stats sourced from Evo magazine, making this the ultimate bench racing game.\r\n \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Unleash your cars on hundreds of racing track challenges with our all-new Card Racing System.\r\n \ud83d\udd27 Manage, upgrade, and tune your stock cars \u2013 become the best motorsport manager.\r\n \ud83e\udd3c Compete against your friends in thrilling scenarios, including drag strips, race circuits, and hill climbs.\r\n \ud83c\udf0d Compete against rivals to win exclusive cars in live multiplayer events.\r\n\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Experience weather effects and multiple surface types, including dirt tracks, asphalt, and snow.\r\n\ud83d\udcf8 Stunning car photography from one of the world's top car magazines.\r\n\ud83c\udfae Turbocharged, addictive, and fun racing strategy gameplay.\r\n\r\nTop Drives offers fast single-player campaigns and multiplayer mayhem modes with speed battles leading to the checkered flag. It's a unique blend of strategic card collecting with a motor-head racing theme!\ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nLet us know what you want to see in the game: www.hutchgames.com\r\nOur Privacy Policy: http://www.hutchgames.com/privacy/\r\nOur Terms of Service: http://www.hutchgames.com/terms-of-service/\r\nTop Drives is FREE to play but offers some optional in-game items that can be purchased for real money. Top Drives includes loot boxes that drop the available items in randomised order. Information about drop rates can be found by selecting a pack in game and tapping the 'Drop Rates' button. Packs can be purchased using in-game currency (Gold and Cash), which can be purchased through IAPs or earned through gameplay. Top Drives is an online game and requires a persistent internet connection to play.\r\n\r\nNeed help?\r\n\r\nYou can reach out to us in-game by going to Settings -> Help & Support, or alternatively you can raise a support ticket by heading here - https://hutch.helpshift.com/hc/en/13-top-drives/contact-us/\r\n\r\nFollow us!\r\n\r\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/topdrivesgame\r\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/topdrives\r\nX - https://twitter.com/topdrivesgame\r\nTikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@topdrivesgame\r\nYoutube - https://www.youtube.com/@topdrives\r\nTwitch - https://www.twitch.tv/topdrivesgame\r\n\r\nJoin the community on the Official Top Drives Discord Server!\r\n\r\nhttps://discord.gg/topdrives",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you a true car enthusiast \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f? If so, turn your attention to Top Drives, the high-octane driving challenge that will put your skills and knowledge to the ultimate test! \ud83c\udfc1<br>\ud83d\ude97 Think you know cars? Top Drives is not your typical racing game; it&#39;s an exciting card collecting game featuring a whopping 4000+ real-life cars. \ud83d\ude98  Collect, compare, and compete in thrilling racing battles against other players. \ud83c\udfc6<br> \ud83d\udd27 Build the ultimate garage of customized cars and create your very own perfect racing deck for supercharged action against your friends or other drivers. Whether you prefer a tuned-up American muscle car, a feisty Japanese hot rod, or going turbo with European agility, you&#39;ll find a car that gets your motor running in Top Drives - the FREE car racing card collection game. \ud83c\udccf<br><br>Top Drives is all about racing cars on a variety of roads, tracks, and challenges. If you like your driving fast and furious, you&#39;ll absolutely love Top Drives. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Hit the gas on asphalt circuits, slide your wheels around twisty tracks, master the art of drifting in the G Force tests, or speed to the checkered flag in a 1-100mph drag race. \ud83d\udea5 Whether it&#39;s a Mustang, Camaro, Porsche Turbo, Audi TT, or Nissan GTR, make sure you&#39;ve got the right car for the right track. You&#39;ll need cars that can perform well in wet conditions, handle off-road challenges, take corners like a pro, and burn rubber for drag races. \ud83c\udf27\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc1<br><br>Why is Top Drives the ultimate motorsport experience for every car enthusiast? Here are the key features that set it apart:<br>\ud83c\udfce\ufe0f Build the perfect car racing deck from over 4000+ officially licensed cars, including marques like McLaren, Bugatti, Pagani, Porsche, Mercedes, Audi, Mustang, and more.<br>\ud83d\udcca Real car stats sourced from Evo magazine, making this the ultimate bench racing game.<br> \ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Unleash your cars on hundreds of racing track challenges with our all-new Card Racing System.<br> \ud83d\udd27 Manage, upgrade, and tune your stock cars \u2013 become the best motorsport manager.<br> \ud83e\udd3c Compete against your friends in thrilling scenarios, including drag strips, race circuits, and hill climbs.<br> \ud83c\udf0d Compete against rivals to win exclusive cars in live multiplayer events.<br>\ud83c\udf26\ufe0f Experience weather effects and multiple surface types, including dirt tracks, asphalt, and snow.<br>\ud83d\udcf8 Stunning car photography from one of the world&#39;s top car magazines.<br>\ud83c\udfae Turbocharged, addictive, and fun racing strategy gameplay.<br><br>Top Drives offers fast single-player campaigns and multiplayer mayhem modes with speed battles leading to the checkered flag. It&#39;s a unique blend of strategic card collecting with a motor-head racing theme!\ud83c\udccf\ud83c\udfc6<br><br>Let us know what you want to see in the game: www.hutchgames.com<br>Our Privacy Policy: http://www.hutchgames.com/privacy/<br>Our Terms of Service: http://www.hutchgames.com/terms-of-service/<br>Top Drives is FREE to play but offers some optional in-game items that can be purchased for real money. Top Drives includes loot boxes that drop the available items in randomised order. Information about drop rates can be found by selecting a pack in game and tapping the &#39;Drop Rates&#39; button. Packs can be purchased using in-game currency (Gold and Cash), which can be purchased through IAPs or earned through gameplay. Top Drives is an online game and requires a persistent internet connection to play.<br><br>Need help?<br><br>You can reach out to us in-game by going to Settings -&gt; Help &amp; Support, or alternatively you can raise a support ticket by heading here - https://hutch.helpshift.com/hc/en/13-top-drives/contact-us/<br><br>Follow us!<br><br>Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/topdrivesgame<br>Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/topdrives<br>X - https://twitter.com/topdrivesgame<br>TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@topdrivesgame<br>Youtube - https://www.youtube.com/@topdrives<br>Twitch - https://www.twitch.tv/topdrivesgame<br><br>Join the community on the Official Top Drives Discord Server!<br><br>https://discord.gg/topdrives",
